{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/\u81ea\u6211\u7597\u6108\u7684\u5fc3\u6d41.gif?t=1745657570\" /><strong>Flow of Self-Healing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a peaceful and soothing environment that effortlessly helps you enter a flow state. Enjoy a selection of calming music and white noise, complemented by the gentle movements of fish and the flowing water in a beautifully landscaped aquarium.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/\u6df1\u5ea6\u4e13\u6ce8.gif?t=1745657570\" /><strong>Deep Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personalize your focus tasks and use time management tools like the Pomodoro timer to cultivate better focus habits and stay concentrated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/\u4e30\u5bcc\u591a\u5f69\u7684\u9c7c\u7f38.gif?t=1745657570\" /><strong>Colorful Aquarium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <i>&quot;Fish Only!&quot;</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore over 300 unique fish.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed them to help them grow, and personalize their home with a variety of decorative elements for a richer focus experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breed rare and one-of-a-kind fish\u2014new life always brings surprises!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the in-game encyclopedia to discover fascinating facts about each fish.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/\u6301\u7eed\u7684\u6210\u957f.gif?t=1745657570\" /><strong>Ongoing Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your focus also nurtures your aquarium\u2014complete tasks to earn extra coins! Whether you're studying, working, or just taking a mental break, a group of adorable fish will always be there to keep you company.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395760?t=1745657570","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395760?t=1745657570","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/7cdea4ba4eb4d645fd88d26274c126bcac6b4bad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745657570","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/7cdea4ba4eb4d645fd88d26274c126bcac6b4bad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745657570","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join the community!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/EN_Wishlist.gif?t=1745657570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our Discord channel to get the latest testing plan!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To get more info, don't forget to follow @SensoryPatch ;)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/\u81ea\u6211\u7597\u6108\u7684\u5fc3\u6d41.gif?t=1745657570\" /><strong>Flow of Self-Healing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a peaceful and soothing environment that effortlessly helps you enter a flow state. Enjoy a selection of calming music and white noise, complemented by the gentle movements of fish and the flowing water in a 